@HostAddress = http://localhost:5283

### Get all documents
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/documents HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### Create a new document
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/documents/create HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Title": "Test Document",
  "CreatorName": "Ayush"
}

### Get a document by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/documents/1 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
